OL,4,CGovernment probe into housing scheme   
OL,5,C'exploitation'                         
OL,6,GThe government has announced an        
OL,7,Gindependent inquiry into allegations   
OL,8,Grogue landlords in Birmingham are      
OL,9,Gmaking huge profits by exploiting a    
OL,10,Ghousing scheme.                        
OL,12,FBBC Panorama reported last month that  
OL,13,Fsome companies in the city were taking 
OL,14,Fadvantage of the Supported Exempt      
OL,15,FAccommodation (SEA) system, intended   
OL,16,Fto provide housing along with care and 
OL,17,Fsupport for vulnerable people.         
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
