OL,4,CMan's shock at Spain flight using      
OL,5,Cwife's passport                        
OL,6,GA man who mistakenly travelled to      
OL,7,GSpain using his wife's passport has    
OL,8,Gsaid he is still baffled about how he  
OL,9,Gwas able to make the trip without      
OL,10,Gbeing stopped in the UK.               
OL,12,FBen Moore, from Talke, in              
OL,13,FStaffordshire, noticed there was a     
OL,14,Fproblem soon after getting off his     
OL,15,FRyanair flight while he was queuing to 
OL,16,Fget his passport checked at Alicante   
OL,17,Fairport.                               
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
