OL,4,CTip trips to be booked in advance      
OL,5,Cunder new plan                         
OL,6,GVisits to Worcestershire household     
OL,7,Grecycling centres would need to be     
OL,8,Gbooked in advance under plans aimed at 
OL,9,Gsaving the county council around       
OL,10,G#500,000 a year.                       
OL,12,FWorcestershire County Council is       
OL,13,Fproposing to introduce a mandatory     
OL,14,Fbooking system at all 11 of its        
OL,15,Frecycling centres. The plans are due   
OL,16,Fto be considered by the cabinet on     
OL,17,FThursday.                              
OL,19,FIf approved, the changes could be      
OL,20,Fintroduced between February and the    
OL,21,Fend of March.                          
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
